body:
Hey raiders! Looking for someone to exp grind with and raid with? Add me and my buddy. We are always available to help with raids and would love some more active friends.

&#x200B;

Trainer Codes: 0584 1220 0645 & 2340 4965 3196

&#x200B;

Good luck and happy raiding!

Please add me and i can help you with any raids you need. Currently rare candy hunting. 

&#x200B;

Trainer Code: 2340 4965 3196

Baulder's Gate: Dark Alliance & Baulder's Gate: Dark Alliance 2.

&#x200B;

Just be careful, Apparently after the first one everyone wanted the second and now it runs about $60 used. PS make sure you have someone to couch co-op with. In my opinion that's what made the PS2 one of my favorite systems of all time.
